{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CghjAjD91ye5u8RBauX9H","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing here is new. No tool call can verify hover focus, a physical mouse or a physical gamepad in this environment.\n\nHere is a checkable, line-by-line pass over TASK.md's own requirement lines. Each has a passing check unless noted:\n\n| TASK.md line | Check |\n|---|---|\n| Genre and Perspective | Rail shooter; third-person rail cameras plus first-person aim, seen in the screenshots and the bot run |\n| Game Title (random draw) | Drawn in PLAN.md by `secrets.randbelow(50)`, index 13; used as given |\n| Package: single HTML named `[GameTitle-SOURCE-model-effort-datetime].html` | `Skiller7-Killer7-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-023141.html` exists in the root |\n| Tech Stack: build on the handoff, engine changes allowed | Built on it; changes marked `S7 PATCH`, and the engine's own tests still pass |\n| Art Direction and Animation | Engine style and rigs, plus new hats, props and guns, seen in screenshots |\n| Audio: all in code, Animalese voices | `features.mjs` passes; the build contains no audio files |\n| Online: AI Hub | Harness passes for 2 players, and 4 with latency, jitter and loss, including host-leave |\n| Scope: feature-complete demo, all mechanics shown | The bot plays a new game to the credits through all six areas and both bosses, in Node and in the real page, with no errors |\n| Dev mode from the pause menu, live sliders, reset | The pause menu shows DEV MODE; `features.mjs` checks the slider and reset |\n| Attract Mode: 10 s idle, any input exits | `attract.mjs`: started at exactly 10.0 s, a key exited it |\n| Multiplayer follows the AI Hub README | The same harness passes |\n| Narrative tone | Killer7-style deadpan in `content/30-story.js` |\n| 10-foot, controller first, PlayStation glyphs, Xbox option | A faked DualSense drives the game with ✕ and L2; Settings has the Xbox option 