ts camera director, the aim, scan and Warm Spot combat, the story beat runner, a controller-first canvas UI kit with glyph prompts, and the laughter and Animalese synths.\n- **Hardest part:** learning the 3D module's units and conventions (pen frames, camera yaw and pitch, fog, terrain extents) from a header comment alone.\n- **What I changed in the engine, and why:** eight new hat styles for the Seven, PlayStation button symbols as the default, and Options ignored while Create is held in a hub session. Each is marked `S7 PATCH`.\n- **One thing I'd change:** make the first-person overlay pass work under any filter, so a gun view model needs no workaround.\n\n## Prompt Feedback\n- **Liked most:** the plan gave a real design with numbers, a flow with timings and a tests chapter, and TASK.md's hard list (attract, dev sliders, hub, 10-foot UI) was unambiguous.\n- **Confusing:** the plan is sized for a far bigger effort than the stated medium effort, and it never says what to cut first.\n- **Hardest thing:** fitting a plan for nine areas, three bosses and forty source files into one working vertical slice with no stubs.\n- **What I'd change:** mark every plan feature must, should or could, and say how much of the plan a lower effort level is expected to deliver."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2206,"cache_read_input_tokens":547633,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2206},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"72551944-ea0f-4259-bd61-d1afd3ec3816","uuid":"0280b0a3-cafa-450f-bef3-906a4fb5473f","timestamp":"2026-11-04T10:30:47.679Z","request_id":"req_011CghjUNzyJBJWoeN4NzhS4"}
